      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. It verifies `MutableClock.equals()` semantics: two clocks sharing the same `InstantHolder` and same zone are equal, but different zones make them unequal. I'll write a more understandable version with descriptive names and clearer intent.Now I'll compile-check the test.The improved test compiles successfully (`COMPILE_OK`)."
